      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im still trying to talk about it. i ruined everything. it wasn't just a mistake, it was something i did that... it caused so much damage. i feel like i'm just a stain on everything i touch now. how do you even live with knowing you're just a bad person at your core?",
